      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "12歳の少年、ヨナタンは厳しい色盲です。",
      "text_en": "A twelve-year-old boy, Jonathan, has severe color blindness.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"12\" data-defn=\"12歳 (number / counter)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">12歳</span><rt>12</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"の\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (&#x27;s / of)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">の</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"しょうねん\" data-defn=\"しょうねん (word)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N3\"><span class=\"si\">少年</span><rt>しょうねん</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"よなたん\" data-defn=\"ヨナタン (loanword / name)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">ヨナタン</span><rt>よなたん</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"いかめしい\" data-defn=\"severe/strict/rigid/unsparing/relentless; hard (to do)/difficult/tricky\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">厳しい</span><rt>いかめしい</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"しきもう\" data-defn=\"color-blindness/colour-blindness\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">色盲</span><rt>しきもう</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"です\" data-defn=\"be / is / are (polite copula)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">です</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
